00:11:50.000 --> 00:11:51.600
OOH I USED TO BE YOU!

00:11:51.860 --> 00:11:53.280
I used to want you..

00:11:53.280 --> 00:11:55.240
Hang on, Markifart's soo-

00:11:55.240 --> 00:11:56.780
Yeah, you wanna play, bruh?

00:11:56.960 --> 00:11:58.020
You wanna play, bruh?!

00:11:58.220 --> 00:11:59.100
YOU WANNA PLAY, BRUH?!

00:11:59.100 --> 00:12:01.600
Come on, come on come on come on! AAAAH COME ON!

00:12:01.980 --> 00:12:02.480
Dammit!

00:12:02.480 --> 00:12:05.800
I want MOOORE! I need MOORE!

00:12:05.880 --> 00:12:08.680
You thought you could run away and escape? The answer is...

00:12:08.680 --> 00:12:12.700
... probably, because I can't seem to finish you off, 'cause I'm sooooo...

00:12:12.700 --> 00:12:13.400
slow.

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.300
