00:12:16.600 --> 00:12:18.760
RRRRRR! Did you die? Maybe?

00:12:18.960 --> 00:12:21.500
I don't know. I don't see any more spray of bullets!

00:12:21.500 --> 00:12:23.660
Ooh, is that you? Is that you, Dami-ohwn?!

00:12:24.020 --> 00:12:24.980
Ooh, there you are!

00:12:25.840 --> 00:12:26.460
Oh, sorry.

00:12:26.460 --> 00:12:29.140
You- you got caught in the crossfire there. I'm after damien.

00:12:29.140 --> 00:12:33.260
Ok. I got two people coming in on both sides! They better not be coordinating to sandwich me!

00:12:33.480 --> 00:12:36.240
Because I don't like being part of a man-meat sandwich!

00:12:36.580 --> 00:12:38.220
Exactly the opposite of what I enjoy!

00:12:38.220 --> 00:12:41.500
How 'bout no? If you're spinning it doesn't make me wanna join your team!

00:12:41.780 --> 00:12:44.560
I- I hate to break to you, but that's not how the world works.

00:12:44.560 --> 00:12:46.880
You is kill? You want is kill??

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:49.700
HUH!? YOU WANT IS KILL?

00:12:50.320 --> 00:12:52.140
YOU WANT IS KILL MAXXPOWER?

00:12:52.140 --> 00:12:56.760
Oh fuck you, alexis. Don't, don't try to double team me, it won't work.

00:12:57.180 --> 00:13:00.760
Well, it PROBABLY WILL WORK. But I'll blame LAG or SOMETHING!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:03.960
You'll NEVER SEE... victory...!

00:13:03.960 --> 00:13:05.220
Spray sporadically...

00:13:05.220 --> 00:13:07.660
(GASP) I got him! I GOT HIM!

00:13:07.660 --> 00:13:09.640
No, I didn't get him. No, that was something else, sorry.

00:13:09.640 --> 00:13:11.520
I thought I got him. False alarm! It's totally cool.

00:13:11.520 --> 00:13:12.580
But where did he go?

00:13:12.580 --> 00:13:16.900
Oh! Doctor donut, I'm... so sorry... that it has to be like this.

00:13:17.200 --> 00:13:21.420
I'm... very sorry doctor donut! I apologize sincerely!

00:13:21.560 --> 00:13:24.520
You just cannot beat... THE MARKIFART!

00:13:24.760 --> 00:13:28.380
Even gunner to gunner, you got the WRRONG UPGRADES!

00:13:28.380 --> 00:13:31.280
I need to recover, though. I can't- I can't encounter anybody else.

00:13:31.400 --> 00:13:33.020
Where the hell did MaxxPower go?!

00:13:33.020 --> 00:13:37.520
If he wasn't- If he wasn't- If he didn't die, then where the hell did he go?

00:13:37.880 --> 00:13:39.300
'Cause that doesn't make any sense!

00:13:39.840 --> 00:13:40.920
Is that MaxxPower over there?

00:13:41.300 --> 00:13:43.460
I don't know, man, I don't know!

00:13:43.460 --> 00:13:44.660
[Mocking username] wdas woo?

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.360
wdas woo!

00:13:46.860 --> 00:13:48.300
WADA WAS WOO?

00:13:48.920 --> 00:13:50.080
WAD WAS WOO?!

00:13:50.900 --> 00:13:52.300
WAD WAS WOO!?

00:13:52.880 --> 00:13:53.700
wad was woo?

00:13:54.160 --> 00:13:55.400
WAD WAS WOO!

00:13:56.180 --> 00:13:57.380
WAD WAS WOO!!

00:13:57.380 --> 00:14:00.040
