00:14:00.040 --> 00:14:01.640
into your ear as you're trying to murder 'em.

00:14:01.920 --> 00:14:03.200
WAD WAS WOO!?

00:14:03.780 --> 00:14:04.720
WWAAADD WAS WOO?!

00:14:04.720 --> 00:14:07.200
Oh, hi Alexis, welcome back to the party!

00:14:07.680 --> 00:14:09.880
