00:14:10.440 --> 00:14:14.940
but death is upon yooou! YEEAAHH!

00:14:14.940 --> 00:14:18.080
Alright, let's go in! Let's not play conservatively anymore!

00:14:18.080 --> 00:14:19.940
Let's be aggressive..

00:14:19.940 --> 00:14:21.860
Oh, there's WOD WAS WOO!

00:14:22.200 --> 00:14:23.920
It's WAD WAS WOO!

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:25.740
OOH BUT THIS IS MINE!!

00:14:25.740 --> 00:14:26.800
Oh shit. Ohh, shit.

00:14:26.960 --> 00:14:28.800
Fuck, that guy was coming for me!

00:14:29.180 --> 00:14:30.700
Oh shit, that guy does high damage.

00:14:30.960 --> 00:14:35.120
Welp, it might be the end of my days, but I'm gonna try my best...

00:14:35.400 --> 00:14:37.560
