00:14:42.260 --> 00:14:44.740
Alright, this is getting very dicey, I think this is gonna be it!

00:14:44.740 --> 00:14:47.320
I think this is gonna be the final battle! I'm gonna go out!

00:14:47.920 --> 00:14:49.840
Aooh!- Oh shit, stole that kill!

00:14:49.840 --> 00:14:53.700
Welp, final battle is... exploitative as always I've ever been!

00:14:54.000 --> 00:14:56.160
Just, run in and steal other people's work.

00:14:56.340 --> 00:14:58.520
And then, claim it as my own... [Sobs]

00:14:58.840 --> 00:15:00.120
Hi Alexis! Hi!

00:15:00.500 --> 00:15:03.860
Sorry, but your bullet stream is not as strong...

00:15:03.860 --> 00:15:06.560
