MAYBE I should hang up my crown and give other people a chance.

00:16:06.800 --> 00:16:08.240
Like sQUA over there.

00:16:08.460 --> 00:16:10.500
Or No-name McDouble Gun!

00:16:10.500 --> 00:16:12.280
Hey, sQUA! You wanna fight sQUA?!

00:16:12.840 --> 00:16:14.040
Oh shit, sQUA might get me.

00:16:14.040 --> 00:16:15.200
sQUA might get me. sQUA got me!

00:16:15.320 --> 00:16:18.600
Ok..WELP, THAT IS ALLL WE WILL SAY ABOUT THAT!

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:22.440
